            "block_content": "The Company will grant reasonable time off the job with pay, as determined by the supervisor, on the Friday afternoon preceding the weekend Periodic Trip where the distance between the applicable Computation Points of the Employee's Work Location and designated Base Location (or Hiring Location, if applicable) is 500 miles or more when such time off is necessary to avoid having the Employee's weekend time at home unreasonably curtailed.",
